WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:07,430
Open the door. The rescue force is here to assist. The crisis has been resolved.

2
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:10,930
This uniform is really a rescue army

3
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:13,430
There are good people out there. We are saved. Open the door.

4
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:28,260
Ma'am, we are the rescue force on a mission nearby.

5
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:31,950
I heard the gunfire and came over. Are you okay?

6
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:36,000
These crossbows were set by you

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
I modified the road

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
They wanted to rob us. We were in self-defense.

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Not only do they want to steal things, they also want to do something to us.

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,080
Things have become chaotic, but there still has to be order.

11
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:49,080
Take these people back and ask them where they are from.
